        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".counter-container": {
              "ul": {
                "margin": "0",
                "list-style": "none",
                "padding-left": "2.5rem",
                "li": {
                  "margin-bottom": "1rem",
                  "position": "relative",
                  "& when (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "list-style": "none",
                    "position": "relative",
                    "padding-left": "1rem",
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-40px",
                      "content": "\"\"",
                      "display": "flex",
                      "justify-content": "center",
                      "align-items": "center",
                      "color": "contrast(@iconColor)",
                      "background-color": "@iconColor",
                      "width": "40px",
                      "height": "40px",
                      "border-radius": "50%",
                      "margin-top": "5px",
                      "& when (@countersType = \"circle\")": {
                        "background": "none",
                        "border": "1px solid @iconColor",
                        "color": "@iconColor"
                      },
                      "& when (@countersType = \"square\")": {
                        "border-radius": "0"
                      },
                      "& when (@mark)": {
                        "content": "\"✓\""
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "& when not (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-1.6rem",
                      "content": "\"\\2022\"",
                      "color": "@iconColor",
                      "font-weight": "bold",
                      "font-size": "2rem",
                      "width": "1.6rem",
                      "line-height": "1.2"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "_name": "content8",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content8\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"12\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stylized\" name=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Mark\" name=\"mark\" checked condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n        <select title=\"Type\" name=\"countersType\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n            <option value=\"default\" selected>Сircle Fill</option>\n            <option value=\"circle\">Circle</option>\n            <option value=\"square\">Square</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#18356a\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Shape your future web project with the Mobirise app.\n                </h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Nutritional Support for Everyday Functions: </b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Reviralis Complete combines vitamins and minerals that have established roles in normal bodily functions. Depending on the amounts supplied, nutrients such as vitamin C, vitamin D, zinc, magnesium, and B vitamins contribute to processes including immune function, energy metabolism, and normal nerve and muscle function. The presence of these ingredients does not automatically mean that everyone needs additional supplementation. People who already receive sufficient nutrients through their diet may experience little additional benefit from taking more. The most sensible way to evaluate this aspect of Reviralis Complete is to compare its verified ingredient quantities with individual dietary needs and the advice of a qualified healthcare professional.</span><br></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Supporting Normal Nervous-System Function:</b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">&nbsp;The manufacturer's formula includes ingredients such as bacopa monnieri, phosphatidylserine, magnesium, and selected B vitamins. These ingredients have different nutritional or research backgrounds, and they should not be treated as interchangeable. Magnesium and certain B vitamins contribute to normal nervous-system function, while bacopa and phosphatidylserine have been studied in other contexts. However, research involving an individual ingredient does not establish that the complete Reviralis Complete formula produces a particular outcome. Its effects depend on the actual amounts, the form of each ingredient, the quality of the research, and individual circumstances. It is best to consider the formula as a nutritional product rather than a proven solution for neurological or stress-related conditions.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Providing Plant-Derived Compounds: </b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">The advertised formula includes botanical ingredients such as olive leaf, green tea extract, grape seed extract, and licorice root extract. Plants contain different compounds that researchers investigate for their biological properties, including antioxidant activity. However, botanical extracts can vary in concentration, preparation, and safety profile. Their presence in a supplement does not establish that the product can prevent infections, control viral activity, or produce a specific medical result. Consumers should check the exact extract descriptions and quantities whenever possible. People who take prescription medicines should also seek professional advice because some botanical ingredients can interact with medicines or may not be suitable for certain health conditions.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>Complementing a Balanced Lifestyle:</b>&nbsp;Reviralis Complete is marketed as a product for ongoing wellness rather than as a replacement for healthy daily habits. Adequate sleep, a balanced diet, regular physical activity, and appropriate stress-management practices remain important parts of general health. A supplement may help fill a particular nutritional gap when its ingredients and amounts are appropriate, but it cannot compensate for every dietary or lifestyle problem. The product's four-step framework is one way the manufacturer explains its formulation, but there is not enough evidence to conclude that following this framework produces guaranteed improvements. A realistic approach is to evaluate the supplement alongside established health habits and any recommendations from a healthcare professional.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>Working Through a Combination of Ingredients:</b>&nbsp;The central idea behind Reviralis Complete is to combine numerous ingredients into a single daily formula. This may be convenient for people who prefer one product instead of purchasing several separate supplements. At the same time, a long ingredient list does not necessarily make a product more effective than a simpler formula. The individual quantities, possible interactions, and relevance of each ingredient matter more than the total number of ingredients alone. The company advertises Reviralis Complete in connection with natural defenses and recurring outbreaks, but the complete product has not been established as a proven treatment for herpes or other viral infections. Consumers should base their decision on transparent product information and appropriate medical guidance.</span></li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
